{
  "name": "Form lead: qualify and route",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Form lead: qualify and route\n\n**What it does**\nYour website form posts here. Each lead is checked against three rules (budget, timeline, decision maker). Qualified leads get your booking link by email and a Slack ping to sales. Everyone else gets a friendly nurture email. Every lead lands in a Google Sheet that works as a simple CRM.\n\n**You need**\nGmail, Slack and Google Sheets credentials, plus a sheet with a tab called `Leads`.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create the `Leads` tab with these headers in row 1: received_at, name, email, phone, company, budget, timeline, decision_maker, message, source, status\n2. Connect your credentials and fill in the yellow notes.\n3. Point your form at the Production URL of **Website form submitted** (POST, JSON or form-encoded) and activate.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 580
      },
      "id": "01cd456b-b668-55c7-9908-a72ed6e352c4",
      "name": "Form lead: qualify and route",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -640,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me: your rules\nChange the minimum budget (2000) and the accepted timelines here. A lead must pass all three checks to count as qualified.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "c499a18c-3edf-514c-a324-46378aaaf44b",
      "name": "Edit me: qualification rules",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me: emails and Slack\nPut your real booking link and signature in both emails, and your sales channel in the Slack node.",
